"description":"Gaming","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:04+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#prima-group","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"prima-group","dateCreated":"2023-05-31T23:29:53+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-20T22:25:53+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Television company Prima Group, based in the Czech Republic, has migrated its iPrima streaming service platform to AWS to boost its ability to scale, and support the growth of its subscriber base. Using AWS, it has improved scaling by a factor of 10, compared to its previous hosting company, and reduced the size of its IT staff by 50 percent. To support platform stability, it uses Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (Amazon EKS). After the migration, it was able to develop Kubernetes clusters in just 14 days, compared to the 2 years it took previously.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/prima-logo%401x.ea97cd42a6073b907f75e3e750e89d8a20177abe.png","displayLocation":"Czech Republic","customerNameLower":"prima group","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","sortDate":"2023-05-24","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/prima-group/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Prima Group","publishedDate":"2023","enableShare":"1","headline":"Prima Group Boosts Streaming Uptime on AWS","contentType":"Customer Story"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#media-entertainment","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","description":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:34+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:07+0000"},{"id":"GLO