o add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#smb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","description":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#mindtickle","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"mindtickle","dateCreated":"2022-07-02T00:19:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:44+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Mindtickle automates more than 95 percent of deployment components, expands to new regions in one day instead of 6–8 months, lowers disaster recovery costs, and ensures data sovereignty and compliance by running on AWS. Mindtickle provides a platform for businesses to prepare and train their sales representatives.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/apac/customer-references-logos-(%401x---%402x)/Mindtickle_logo%401x.3873fee6113f4a9b71627f01324506fbccf2f63f.png","displayLocation":"India","customerNameLower":"mindtickle","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2022-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/mindtickle/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Mindtickle","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Mindtickle Expands to New Regions in One Day with Platform Automation on AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#india","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"India","description":"India","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:38+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:46+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cloudformation","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS CloudFormation","description":"AWS CloudFormation","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:55+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#apac","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Asia Pacific","description":"Asia Pacific","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:10+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:35+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#step-functions","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Step Functions","description":"AWS Step Functions","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:02+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#mid-market","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Mid-Market","description":"Mid-Market","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#eks","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (EKS)","description":"Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (EKS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#route53","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Route 53","description":"Amazon Route 53","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#methodology#devops","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#methodology","name":"DevOps","description":"DevOps","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T07:06:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:10+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#app-integration","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Application Integration","description":"Application Integration","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#mgmt-govern","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Management \u0026 Governance","description":"Management \u0026 Governance","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:21+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:28+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#networking-content-dev","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","description":"Networking \u0026 Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:29+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#software-internet","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Software \u0026 Internet","description":"Software \u0026 Internet","dateCreated":"2020-06-25T04:08:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#devops","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"DevOps","description":"DevOps","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:49+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-05T03:54:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#smb","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","description":"Small and Midsize Business (SMB)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#jotabasso","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"jotabasso","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:04:29+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-06-08T04:07:49+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"A Jotabasso é uma empresa brasileira de sementes e agricultura com sede no Cerrado, que é uma ecorregião de savana tropical que se estende por grande parte do Brasil central e se tornou popular para atividades agrícolas no final dos anos 1990 e início dos anos 2000. A empresa também trabalha com diversos setores de diferentes operações agrícolas.\n\nA Jotabasso se originou no Rio Grande do Sul antes de se mudar para a região do Cerrado na década de 1970. Foi uma das primeiras empresas de sementes daquela região e hoje tem mais de 900 funcionários, com cinco unidades de produção nas áreas centrais do Brasil.\n\nHoje, a empresa é especializada no plantio de soja e outros grãos, como trigo, milho e sorgo, que são usados principalmente como ração animal. A Jotabasso também se aventurou na criação de gado de corte. A organização opera grandes laboratórios de análise de sementes e instalações de armazenamento e criou um sistema integrado de lavoura-pecuária e confinamento para ajudar os agricultores a aumentar a produtividade e a sustentabilidade.\n\nPara manter e expandir todas as suas atividades com maior eficiência, a Jotabasso decidiu procurar um provedor de nuvem que pudesse hospedar seus dados e ajudar a empresa a criar soluções tecnológicas inovadoras para suas operações e usuários.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/jotabasso-logo%402x.e706d28cc6c94d999729b54b3f38986197427921.png","displayLocation":"Brasil","customerNameLower":"jotabasso","footerInfoText":"Data de publicação","industry":"Varejo","sortDate":"2022-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/pt/solutions/case-studies/jotabasso/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Jotabasso","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"História do cliente","headline":"Modernizando a agricultura em grande escala com a nuvem AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ebs","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Elastic Block Store (EBS)","description":"Amazon Elastic Block Store (EBS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#vpc","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon VPC","description":"Amazon VPC","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:06:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:33:06+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","