erences#industry#travel-and-hospitality","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"travel-and-hospitality","description":"\u003cp\u003eAs of 4/2023, this tag is initially being used specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/travel-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#metron","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"metron","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:05:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-18T00:18:09+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"\u003cp\u003eMETRON accompagne les industriels dans la gestion de leur \u0026eacute;nergie via une plateforme logicielle METRON SaaS afin de r\u0026eacute;duire leur empreinte carbone. Gr\u0026acirc;ce \u0026agrave; la couverture mondiale d\u0026rsquo;AWS, METRON peut impl\u0026eacute;menter sa plateforme SaaS pour fournir une visibilit\u0026eacute; compl\u0026egrave;te de la gestion de l\u0026rsquo;\u0026eacute;nergie et les opportunit\u0026eacute;s d\u0026#39;optimisation (Energy Management \u0026amp; Optimisation System) d\u0026rsquo;un site ou de plusieurs sites, en France et dans le monde.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/METRON%20logo.d8cf1ffb6185291c9a98adc5322fe83b959400ee.jpg","displayLocation":"Europe, Moyen-Orient et Afrique","footerInfoText":"Date de publication","industry":"Services professionnels","sortDate":"2022-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/fr/solutions/case-studies/metron/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"METRON","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2022","contentType":"Témoignages clients","headline":"METRON décarbone les entreprises du monde entier grâce à l’agilité de sa plateforme SaaS hébergée sur AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#cost-mgmt","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Cloud Financial Management","description":"Cloud Financial Management","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:13+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#containers","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Containers","description":"Containers","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:32+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:37+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#cost-explorer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Cost Explorer","description":"AWS Cost Explorer","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:27+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#produc