ized its infrastructure using AWS container and video services to reduce deployment time from 0.5–1.5 hours to 10 minutes or less and open up new lines of business. Magnetic Asia is an events management and production company based in Hong Kong. The company is using Amazon EKS to run containerized applications, AWS Elemental MediaLive and AWS Elemental MediaPackage to enable livestreaming, and Amazon DynamoDB to tokenize events.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/magnetic-asia-logo%401x.4855a628a479fc2a6e83c85605912f63cdb8e658.png","displayLocation":"Hong Kong","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","sortDate":"2021-08-20","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/magneticasia/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Magnetic Asia","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2021","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Magnetic Asia Keeps Entertainment Alive with Livestreaming Services on AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#content-delivery","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Content Delivery","description":"Content Delivery","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:34+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:38+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#databases","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#media-entertainment"