-experience","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"aws-is-how-mcdonalds-transforms-the-drive-thru-experience","dateCreated":"2021-07-02T00:57:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-12T01:40:50+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Using multiple AWS services for data management and machine learning, McDonald’s provides drive-thru customers with recommendations based on a variety of factors including past orders, location, and time of day.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/McDonalds_Customer-Reference_Logo.8197f6c1344756e2051566dbaa8a463bbc552030.png","displayLocation":"United States","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Travel \u0026 Hospitality","sortDate":"2021-07-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/industries/aws-is-how-mcdonalds-transforms-the-drive-thru-experience/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2021","customer-name":"McDonald\u0027s","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"AWS is How: McDonald’s Transforms the Drive-thru Experience"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#hospitality","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Hospitality","description":"Hospitality","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:27+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:05+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#namer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"North America","description":"North America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#cus