,"dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#serverless","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Serverless","description":"Serverless","dateCreated":"2021-07-28T18:46:39+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#blog-post","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Blog Post","description":"Blog Post","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:06+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#s3","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","description":"Amazon Simple Storage Service (S3)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:05:09+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:58+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#travel","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Travel","description":"Travel","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#eks","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (EKS)","description":"Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (EKS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:32+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#travel-and-hospitality","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"travel-and-hospitality","description":"\u003cp\u003eAs of 4/2023, this tag is initially being used specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/travel-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#itv-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"itv-case-study","dateCreated":"2021-05-22T01:39:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-12-22T19:06:45+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"ntegrated producer-broadcaster ITV migrated its workloads to Amazon EKS on Amazon EC2 Spot Instances, significantly reducing compute spending despite having its highest viewership ever.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/itv_1x.956a5596460df3a1167fba6e20c2924e997e5ebd.png","displayLocation":"United Kingdom","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","sortDate":"2021-05-21","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/itv-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2021","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"ITV Saves $150,000 in Compute Costs by Using Amazon EKS on Amazon EC2 Spot Instances","customer-name":"ITV"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#video","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Video","description":"Video","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:11+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:30+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#media-entertainment","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","description":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:34+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#uk","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"United Kingdom","description":"United Kingdom","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:18+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:52+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#europe","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe","description":"Europe","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise (ENT)","description":"Enterprise (ENT)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:14+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#ec2","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon EC2","description":"Amazon EC2","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:51+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#eks","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (EKS)","description":"Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (EKS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#ukir","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"UK/IR","description":"UK/IR","dateCreated":"2020-02-19T23:06:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:51+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#enterprise","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Enterprise","description":"Enterprise","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:40+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-05T01:27:39+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#sundaytoz-video-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"sundaytoz-video-case-study","dateCreated":"2021-05-22T01:36:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:48+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"SundayToz is a casual game developer that creates social games for online and mobile platforms. Based in Korea, SundayToz is most known for creating the Anipang series and games featuring global intellectual property, such as Disney POP TOWN and the We Bare Bears puzzle. In this video, CTO Chang-myeong Lee and technical director Sungpil Jo of SundayToz explain how migrating to Amazon Web Services (AWS) from on-premises Internet Data Centers (IDCs) enabled SundayToz to increase the scalability, stability, and security of its game portfolio.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/SundayToz_logo%401X.4c2126996eaed90b5960e98f73749c46b