(SMB)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#new-relic-case-study","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"new-relic-case-study","dateCreated":"2021-05-22T01:39:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-12-23T00:55:58+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Founded in 2008, New Relic is a leader in the observability space, providing engineers with a software-as-a-service (SaaS) platform that analyzes, troubleshoots, and optimizes their entire software stack. In 2020, New Relic went on a journey to transform its business, moving from a host-based to a consumption-based pricing model. In addition, New Relic introduced a free service tier to all customers and prepared for a significant increase in demand on its platform.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/new-relic-logo%401x.3104541e903ed9ae838ad315973a4cb9b82eac98.png","displayLocation":"United States","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2021-05-21","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/new-relic-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2021","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"New Relic Shifts Business Mode, Manages Unprecedented Growth with Amazon EKS","customer-name":"New Relic"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#containers","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Containers","description":"Containers","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:32+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-19T05:00:37+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#namer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"North America","descr