ning databases, analytics, business intelligence, and machine learning for an end-to-end data strategy.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2024-02-14T22:32:15+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-02-14T22:32:15+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#thorn-safer-smugmug","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"thorn-safer-smugmug","dateCreated":"2021-02-26T22:44:34+0000","dateUpdated":"2021-12-22T22:38:26+0000","additionalFields":{"featured":"0","descriptionSummary":"On AWS, Thorn built Safer to detect, report, and remove child sexual abuse material from online content-hosting sites and validated its efficacy, flexibility, and scalability with beta customer Flickr, SmugMug\u0027s photo-hosting site.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/thorn-smugmug-logo%401x.9d9678c36dc68310bfb6b6b4f1be6056547f8c7a.png","displayLocation":"United States","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Software \u0026 Internet","sortDate":"2021-02-26","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/thorn-safer-smugmug/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Thorn","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2021","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Safer, Built by Thorn, Combats Child Sexual Abuse Material on Content-Hosting Sites Using AWS-Powered Solution"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#location#namer","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"North America","description":"North America","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#public-sector-nonprofit","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Nonprofit","description":"Nonprofit","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39: