he page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can use the AND operator to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:23:44+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#benx20210208","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"benx20210208","dateCreated":"2022-05-23T21:41:00+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-05-23T21:52:22+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Learn how Weverse Company (previously beNX), a tech subsidiary of Big Hit Entertainment, handles massive traffic spikes from global fans with a highly scalable architecture on AWS. Weverse dives deep into its event-driven auto-scaling, IaaC, and Spot instance architecture to handle ~100x traffic spikes within minutes from 7M+ global users from 229 countries in a cost-effective way. Especially, Weverse introduces their open source deployment tool, Goployer (https://goployer.dev/), AWS Development tool, what it is and how it works, and why people use it. In addition, learn how Weverse will use EKS on Fargate as a next step.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/Customer%20References%20Directory%20Logos/weverse-logo%401x.071a06a93d394bb04363a30f82deba8e8a5df4f3.png","displayLocation":"Korea","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Media \u0026 Entertainment","sortDate":"2021-02-08","headlineUrl":"https://youtu.be/cIqVilu7KUM?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2021","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Weverse Company (previously beNX): Architecture Changes to Handle Massive Peak Traffic","customer-name":"Weverse Company"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#product#lambda","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"AWS Lambda","description":"AWS Lambda","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:04:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:4