ore contacts with fewer resources than before.\u003c/p\u003e\r\n","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/emea-customer-references/emea-directory-customer-logos/Traventia-Customer-References-Logo%401x.6a31888bc5f85dc6fba0a48d7d688f5678e2c46a.png","displayLocation":"Spain","customerNameLower":"traventia","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Travel","sortDate":"2021-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/solutions/case-studies/traventia-case-study/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","customer-name":"Traventia","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2021","contentType":"Customer Story","headline":"Traventia Uses Amazon Connect to Reach its Destination"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#customer-segment#startup","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#customer-segment","name":"Startup","description":"Startup","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:39:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-15T04:54:51+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#customer-segment#startup","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#customer-segment","name":"Startup (SUP)","description":"Startup (SUP)","dateCreated":"2021-06-04T06:35:50+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:16+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#emea","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","description":"Europe, Middle East, \u0026 Africa","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:43+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#europe","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe","description":"Europe","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#iberia","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Iberia","description":"Iberia","dateCreated":"2020-04-09T03:37:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:49+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#business-apps","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Business Applications","description":"Business Applications","dateCreated":"2020-08-20T04:22:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#business-category#cust-engagement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#business-category","name":"Customer Engagement","description":"Customer Engagement","dateCreated":"2020-06-05T07:06:46+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:03+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#customer-story","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Customer Story","description":"Customer Story","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:24+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#eks","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (EKS)","description":"Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (EKS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:32+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#spain","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Spain","description":"Spain","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:30:16+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:49+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#content-type#case-study","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#content-type","name":"Case Study","description":"Case Study","dateCreated":"2020-04-29T05:19:20+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:07+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#compute","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Compute","description":"Compute","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:11+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#analytics","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Analytics","description":"Analytics","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:03+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:22+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#industry#travel","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#industry","name":"Travel","description":"Travel","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:42:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:09+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#customer-engagement","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Customer Engagement","description":"Customer Engagement","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:37+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-21T23:37:45+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#english","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"English","description":"English","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:42+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:23+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#connect","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Connect","description":"Amazon Connect","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:22+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:26+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#industry#travel-and-hospitality","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"travel-and-hospitality","description":"\u003cp\u003eAs of 4/2023, this tag is initially being used specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/travel-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#ank","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"ank","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:12:04+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-14T23:32:27+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Para lograr su objetivo de simplificar la vida de las personas, la fintech argentina ank permite administrar múltiples cuentas bancarias mediante una sola app fácil, rápida y segura. Para esto desarrolló la función de envío de dinero desde una cuenta bancaria a otras cuentas CBU/CVU y los pagos mediante códigos QR interoperables.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/ank-logo%402x.9690ffa6141ab90121f2f968ae1c06e41aad2cf0.png","displayLocation":"Argentina","footerInfoText":"Fecha de publicación","industry":"Servicios financieros","sortDate":"2021-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/es/solutions/case-studies/ank/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2021","customer-name":"ank","contentType":"Historia del cliente","headline":"ank entrega mejores servicios a sus clientes con proceso de conciliación basado en AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#category#business-applications","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Business Applications","description":"Business Applications","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:07+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-03-17T20:28:40+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#language#spanish","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#language","name":"Spanish","description":"Spanish","dateCreated":"2020-03-03T06:40:59+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:26+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#batch-processing","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Batch Processing","description":"Batch Processing","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:02+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-26T01:35:02+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#containers","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Containers","description":"Containers","dateCreated":"2020-02-13T00:27:17+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:26+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#business-apps","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Business Applications","description":"Business Applications","dateCreate