ly being used specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/travel-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#laura","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"laura","dateCreated":"2023-06-01T23:08:29+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-07-12T01:35:23+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"O funcionamento da Robô Laura exige a análise de um grande volume de dados e o monitoramento contínuo dos pacientes. A solução usa inteligência artificial para ajudar as equipes médicas a identificar problemas em pacientes internados antes que eles se tornem irreversíveis.","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/case-studies/Latam%20Cases%20Assets/Laura_LOGO_1.c98e953f0956e3238882cfe3c7bcb2f131b36360.png","displayLocation":"Brasil","footerInfoText":"Data de publicação","industry":"Saúde","sortDate":"2019-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/pt/solutions/case-studies/laura/?did\u003dcr_card\u0026trk\u003dcr_card","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2019","customer-name":"Laura","contentType":"História do cliente","headline":"Com análise de dados avançada e inteligência artificial, robô Laura salva doze vidas por dia"}},"tags":[{"id":"GLOBAL#language#portuguese","locale":"en_US","tagNam