":"Databases","description":"Databases","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:14+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:27+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:32:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-12T02:01:31+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#tech-category#storage","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#tech-category","name":"Storage","description":"Storage","dateCreated":"2020-01-16T17:43:35+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:33+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#api-gateway","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon API Gateway","description":"Amazon API Gateway","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:01:25+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:16+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#product#eks","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#product","name":"Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (EKS)","description":"Amazon Elastic Kubernetes Service (EKS)","dateCreated":"2020-03-02T07:02:58+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:32:32+0000"}]},{"item":{"id":"customer-references#delivery-hero-it","locale":"en_US","directoryId":"customer-references","name":"delivery-hero-it","dateCreated":"2024-11-12T00:54:28+0000","dateUpdated":"2024-11-12T01:13:40+0000","additionalFields":{"descriptionSummary":"Delivery Hero è passato da un\u0027idea ambiziosa a una delle principali società di consegne locali. Con la missione di consegnare qualsiasi cosa direttamente alla porta del cliente, Delivery Hero ha iniziato a costruire su Amazon Web Services (AWS) circa un mese dopo il suo lancio. Ora è all\u0027avanguardia nell\u0027innovazione, operando con una rete di marchi in 70 Paesi in quattro continenti.","featured":"0","imageSrcUrl":"https://d1.awsstatic.com/customer-references-case-studies-logos/deliveryhero-logo%402x.38caeae76f51b2ee2ec5c5de92b8863fa8ce7be1.png","displayLocation":"DACH","customerNameLower":"delivery hero","footerInfoText":"Published Date","industry":"Hospitality","sortDate":"2019-01-01","headlineUrl":"https://aws.amazon.com/it/solutions/case-studies/innovators/delivery-hero/","customer-name":"Delivery Hero","enableShare":"1","publishedDate":"2019","contentType":"Storia del cliente","headline":"Delivery Hero su AWS"}},"tags":[{"id":"customer-references#industry#travel-and-hospitality","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#industry","name":"travel-and-hospitality","description":"\u003cp\u003eAs of 4/2023, this tag is initially being used specifically for the Directory Cards componenet on aws.amazon.com/travel-and-hospitality/case-studies/. When the GCRP decided to add multilingual content to the CSDIR in 2023, the owners of this page only wanted to display the English content in our Directory. Because the Directory Cards component on their page uses an OR operator to pull in content from two tags, they would be unable to add a prefilter condition to look for only English content. This can only be done if the page is using an AND operator. Thus, this tag will be autoapplied to all content that meets the current prefilter conditions. At that point, the page owners can switch to the AND operator, enabling them to display content with this tag and GLOBAL#language#english.\u003c/p\u003e\n","dateCreated":"2019-07-17T22:21:56+0000","dateUpdated":"2023-04-26T20:41:02+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#use-case#business-apps","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#use-case","name":"Business Applications","description":"Business Applications","dateCreated":"2020-08-20T04:22:48+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:35:34+0000"},{"id":"GLOBAL#location#europe","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"GLOBAL#location","name":"Europe","description":"Europe","dateCreated":"2020-02-03T05:29:45+0000","dateUpdated":"2022-02-03T03:31:40+0000"},{"id":"customer-references#category#containers","locale":"en_US","tagNamespaceId":"customer-references#category","name":"Containers","description":"Containers","dateCreated":"2019-07-22T18:31:3